---

<AppDesignLayout
  title="FUSOU-APP - Design System & Component Catalog"
  description="FUSOU-APP (Tauri デスクトップアプリケーション) の実装 (src/global.css, src/components/**) と 1:1 対応した独立カタログページです。"
>
  <div
    class="mb-8 border-b border-base-300 pb-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4"
  >
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <span class="badge badge-outline badge-sm">Tauri v2 Desktop</span>
        <span class="badge badge-outline badge-sm">Solid.js 1.9</span>
        <span class="badge badge-outline badge-sm">DaisyUI 5.7</span>
        <span class="badge badge-success badge-sm">Isolated FUSOU-APP CSS</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">FUSOU-APP Design System</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-base-content/70 mt-1">
        packages/FUSOU-APP/src/global.css
        と実装コンポーネントをそのまま再現したデスクトップアプリ専用カタログ
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <a href="#quick-jump" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm"> 目次へジャンプ </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Quick Jump Nav -->
  <nav
    id="quick-jump"
    aria-label="Design system sections"
    class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-5 mb-8"
  >
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
      <span
        class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-base-content/60"
      >
        Quick Navigation
      </span>
      <span class="text-xs text-base-content/50"
        >Source: packages/FUSOU-APP/src/global.css &amp; components/**</span
      >
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-sm">
      <a href="#section-colors" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >01 Colors &amp; Tokens</a
      >
      <a href="#section-typography" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >02 Typography &amp; Density</a
      >
      <a href="#section-window" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >03 Frameless Window &amp; Titlebar</a
      >
      <a href="#section-buttons" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >04 Buttons &amp; Tools</a
      >
      <a href="#section-cards" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >05 Cards &amp; Accordions</a
      >
      <a href="#section-forms" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >06 Form &amp; Controls</a
      >
      <a href="#section-alerts" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >07 Alerts, Toast &amp; Policy</a
      >
      <a href="#section-icons" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >08 UI Primitives &amp; Icons</a
      >
      <a href="#section-modals" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >09 Ship &amp; Equipment Modals</a
      >
      <a href="#section-deck" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >10 Fleet &amp; Deck Layout</a
      >
      <a href="#section-battles" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >11 Combat &amp; Summary</a
      >
      <a href="#section-base-ops" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >12 LBAS, Materials &amp; Quests</a
      >
      <a href="#section-inventory" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline rounded-md"
        >13 Component Inventory</a
      >
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="space-y-12">
    <!-- 01 / COLOR PALETTE & TOKENS -->
    <section id="section-colors" class="scroll-mt-16">
      <div class="border-b border-base-300 pb-3 mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
          01 / Color Palette &amp; OKLCH Tokens
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60 mt-1">
          <code>packages/FUSOU-APP/src/global.css</code> の DaisyUI 5 OKLCH テーマトークンおよび実コードで使用されているタイトルバー・状態カラー。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">
            DaisyUI Semantic Theme Tokens (<code>src/global.css</code>)
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-7 gap-3">
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-3">
              <div
                class="h-10 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-primary"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">primary</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                oklch(87% 0.15 154.449)
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-3">
              <div
                class="h-10 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-secondary"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">secondary</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                oklch(89% 0.196 126.665)
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-3">
              <div
                class="h-10 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-accent"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">accent</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                oklch(86% 0.127 207.078)
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-3">
              <div class="h-10 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-info">
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">info</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                oklch(68% 0.169 237.323)
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-3">
              <div
                class="h-10 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-success"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">success</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                oklch(76% 0.233 130.85)
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-3">
              <div
                class="h-10 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-warning"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">warning</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                oklch(70% 0.213 47.604)
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-3">
              <div class="h-10 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-error">
              </div>
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">error</div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                oklch(63% 0.237 25.331)
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">
            Theme Base Surfaces &amp; Titlebar Brand Hex Colors
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-4">
              <div
                class="h-12 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-base-100"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="font-medium text-sm">base-100 / base-200</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                Light: 100% / Dark: 21.6% OKLCH
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 mt-1">
                Window container &amp; list background
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-4">
              <div
                class="h-12 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-300 bg-base-300"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="font-medium text-sm">base-300</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                Light: 92% / Dark: 27% OKLCH
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 mt-1">
                Borders, badges (--radius-box: 0.5rem)
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-4">
              <div
                class="h-12 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-content/20"
                style="background-color: #27272a;"
              >
              </div>
              <div class="font-medium text-sm">Titlebar Chrome</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                #27272a / Popover: #1d1c1c
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 mt-1">
                32px Tauri header &amp; volume menu
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-4">
              <div
                class="h-12 rounded-md mb-2 border border-base-content/20 flex overflow-hidden"
              >
                <div class="flex-1" style="background-color: #B5D95A;"></div>
                <div class="flex-1" style="background-color: #96C54E;"></div>
                <div class="flex-1" style="background-color: #76B142;"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="font-medium text-sm">Brand Logo Greens</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-base-content/60 font-mono">
                #B5D95A / #96C54E / #76B142
              </div>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 mt-1">
                Titlebar 3-bar SVG &amp; range thumb
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">
            ComponentColorBar &amp; Operational Tailwind Status Classes (<code
              >color-bar.tsx</code
            >)
          </h3>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-6 gap-3">
            <div class="p-3 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">v_now == v_max</div>
              <progress
                class="progress w-full text-green-500 h-1 my-2"
                value="100"
                max="100"></progress>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                <code>text-green-500</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">&gt; 75% (健在)</div>
              <progress
                class="progress w-full text-lime-500 h-1 my-2"
                value="91.7"
                max="100"></progress>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                <code>text-lime-500</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">&gt; 50% (小破)</div>
              <progress
                class="progress w-full text-yellow-500 h-1 my-2"
                value="65"
                max="100"></progress>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                <code>text-yellow-500</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">&gt; 25% (中破)</div>
              <progress
                class="progress w-full text-orange-500 h-1 my-2"
                value="38"
                max="100"></progress>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                <code>text-orange-500</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium">&lt;= 25% (大破)</div>
              <progress
                class="progress w-full text-red-500 h-1 my-2"
                value="19.4"
                max="100"></progress>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                <code>text-red-500</code>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              class="p-3 rounded-box border border-base-300 bg-base-100 text-xs space-y-1"
            >
              <div class="text-green-500">text-green-500</div>
              <div class="text-lime-500">text-lime-500</div>
              <div class="text-orange-500">text-orange-500</div>
              <div class="text-yellow-500">text-yellow-500</div>
              <div class="text-red-500">text-red-500</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 02 / TYPOGRAPHY & DENSITY -->
    <section id="section-typography" class="scroll-mt-16">
      <div class="border-b border-base-300 pb-3 mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
          02 / Typography &amp; Real App Usage
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60 mt-1">
          <code>global.css</code> は戦術 SVG バッジ用に Roboto Mono を読み込み、通常テーブル・一覧はシステムのサンセリフ体（<code
            >text-xs</code
          >/<code>text-sm</code>）を使用します。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 p-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="border-b border-base-300/40 pb-3">
          <div class="text-xs text-base-content/50">
            Page Headings (<code>start.tsx</code>, <code>policy_panel.tsx</code
            >): <code>text-xl font-bold</code> / <code
              >text-lg font-semibold</code>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xl font-bold text-base-content mt-1">
            通信保全基準
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-base-300/40 pb-3">
          <div class="text-xs text-base-content/50">
            Deck / Battle / Material / Quest Lists: デフォルト Sans <code
              >text-xs</code
            > / <code>text-sm</code>（<code>font-mono</code> 未使用）
          </div>
          <div
            class="text-xs text-base-content mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4"
          >
            <span>第1艦隊</span>
            <span>大和改二</span>
            <span>55/60</span>
            <span class="badge badge-md border-base-300 w-9">75</span>
            <span class="text-sm">184</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-b border-base-300/40 pb-3">
          <div class="text-xs text-base-content/50">
            Explicit Monospace Scopes: <code>ErrorFallback.tsx</code> (stack trace)
            &amp; <code>data_collection_status.tsx</code>
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs font-mono text-base-content/80 mt-1">
            dataset_id: 2026-11-10-telemetry-snapshot
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="text-xs text-base-content/50">
            SVG Embedded Font (<code>Roboto Mono wght@500</code> / <code
              >font.css</code
            >): Ship Type &amp; Equipment Code Icons
          </div>
          <div class="text-xs mt-1 text-base-content/70">
            DE, DD, CL, CA, CV, BB, PA, SA, TO, CA, RE, RA
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 03 / FRAMELESS WINDOW & CUSTOM TITLEBAR -->
    <section id="section-window" class="scroll-mt-16">
      <div class="border-b border-base-300 pb-3 mb-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">
          03 / Frameless Window &amp; Custom Titlebar
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-base-content/60 mt-1">
          <code>src/components/ui/titlebar.tsx</code> および <code
            >src/pages/app.tsx</code
          > に基づく 32px フレームレスタイトルバーとウィンドウタブシェル。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 text-xs"
        >
          <span class="font-medium text-base-content/80"
            >タイトルバー状態モック実演:</span
          >
          <button
            type="button"
            id="toggle-max-btn"
            class="btn btn-xs btn-outline"
            onclick="
                const frame = document.getElementById('mock-app-frame');
                const isMax = frame.classList.toggle('is-maximized');
                this.textContent = isMax ? 'ウィンドウモードに戻す' : '最大化モードに切り替え';
              "
          >
            最大化モードに切り替え
          </button>
        </div>

        <div
          id="mock-app-frame"
          class="fusou-app-window-mock border border-base-300"
        >
          <!-- Custom Titlebar (titlebar.tsx exact) -->
          <header
            class="flex justify-between items-center h-8 bg-[#27272a] text-[#e5e7eb] select-none px-2.5 text-xs shrink-0"
          >
            <!-- Left: 3-bar SVG Logo + FUSOU -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pointer-events-none">
              <svg
                class="w-4 h-4 shrink-0"
                viewBox="0 0 1000 1000"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <rect
                  x="150"
                  y="73"
                  width="750"
                  height="225"
                  rx="75"
                  fill="#B5D95A"></rect>
                <rect
                  x="150"
                  y="388"
                  width="450"
                  height="225"
                  rx="75"
                  fill="#96C54E"></rect>
                <rect
                  x="150"
                  y="703"
                  width="225"
                  height="225"
                  rx="75"
                  fill="#76B142"></rect>
              </svg>
              <span class="font-bold tracking-wider text-[11px] opacity-90"
                >FUSOU</span
              >
            </div>

            <!-- Center / Right: Tool Buttons -->
            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
              <button
                type="button"
                title="Capture Screenshot (External Window)"
                class="fusou-tool-btn"
              >
                <svg
                  class="w-3.5 h-3.5"
                  fill="none"
                  viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                  stroke="currentColor"
                  stroke-width="2"
                >
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    d="M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z"
                  ></path>
                  <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
